Read [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) before making changes.

- Client-only React app; rules in memory, no backend
- SecLang/CRSLang via `public/wasm/` crslang; API in `src/lib/crslangWasm.ts`
- Edit model: `ParsedRule` in `src/types/rules.ts`
- CRS schema/UI options: `src/constants/crsRuleSchema.ts`
- Do not modify `documentation/` submodule during app work
- Code and comments in English; minimal diffs
